OL,3,GNEWSAResidents still out of homes
OL,4,Anearly three years after Baberton
OL,5,Aexplosion
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of residents of an Edinburgh
OL,8,Fstreet are still waiting to return to
OL,9,Ftheir homes nearly three years after a
OL,10,Fgas explosion destroyed two houses and
OL,11,Fforced the evacuation of others.
OL,13,FThe explosion happened on 1 December
OL,14,F2023 on Baberton Mains Avenue in
OL,15,FEdinburgh. James Smith, 84, was killed
OL,16,Fin the blast and two others were taken
OL,17,Fto hospital.
OL,19,FGary Taylor, who lived a few houses
OL,20,Fdown, was not injured but has been out
OL,21,Fof his home since.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
